# Brewfile.brain — brain role extras (per-location data server, e.g. buchanan-brain)
# The central database and the tools the scheduled pulls need.
# Installed by setup.sh after the common Brewfile when --role brain.
#
# No Apple-only tools here: no Reminders sync, no Xcode, no App Store sign-in.

# Database: Homebrew's SQLite is newer than the one macOS ships.
brew "sqlite"

# Claude admin logins live in 1Password; the pulls read them with `op`.
cask "1password-cli"
